@verbs block unblock blocking
@tier player
@title no longer receiving somebody's messages
@see say earmuffs consent

  block                     lists who you are blocking.
  block <player>            blocks them.
  unblock <player>          unblocks them.

While you block somebody, their tells and whispers do not reach you,
they cannot use emotes on you, and they cannot invite you to a party.
Every time they try, they learn that you are blocking them.

The block belongs to your account, not to the character: it holds for
every character you play from it, and it lasts from one session to
the next. Only a character that exists can be blocked.
